<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <picture>
    <source srcset="/cycanic-full.webp" type="image/webp" />
    <img class="about-fig" src="/cycanic-full.png" width="453" height="900" alt="" />
  </picture>
  <p><strong>cycanics</strong> is a cybernetic mechanic's workshop. It takes ideas people are discussing in AI —
  a new paper, a claim, a technique — runs them on real systems, and publishes what happened, with numbers and code.</p>
  <p>The tools built along the way are published too, and keep being developed: see <a href="/repos/">Repos</a>.
  New articles and releases appear here and in the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.</p>
  <p>Questions and corrections: open an issue in the relevant repository on <a href="https://github.com/cycanics">GitHub</a>.</p>
</Base>
